      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781070968242,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "prev_free_block and next_free_block attributes of the given blocks.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "prev_free_block and next_free_block attributes of the given blocks.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "3URwvaj26RwAzzQ_sVk5v",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 663.2429428100586,
      "y": -12636.984718322754,
      "width": 556.1798095703125,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "al",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 947783945,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1802251017,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781070968242,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "该类将一组 `KVCacheBlock` 对象组织成一个空闲块双向链表。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "该类将一组 `KVCacheBlock` 对象组织成一个空闲块双向链表。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "O4ekLNeMCVMtLQThSDR4e",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 550.4029769897461,
      "y": -12614.484718322754,
      "width": 781.8597412109375,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "am",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 487172103,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1896261127,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781070968242,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "我们选择实现该类而非使用 Python 内置的 `deque`，是为了支持在 O(1) 时间复杂度内移\n除队列中间的某个块。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "我们选择实现该类而非使用 Python 内置的 `deque`，是为了支持在 O(1) 时间复杂度内移除队列中间的某个块。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "FyuYkJ99-XZcf7uwXXOwy",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 556.8529281616211,
      "y": -12554.484718322754,
      "width": 768.9598388671875,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "an",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1338638313,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 77849065,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781070968242,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "为了缩小与 C++ 实现的内置 `deque` 之间的性能差距，该类在操作链表时不会分配任何\nPython 对象，",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "为了缩小与 C++ 实现的内置 `deque` 之间的性能差距，该类在操作链表时不会分配任何 Python 对象，",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "qj_lCnTnHGNOQzyjE1QyY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 633.753044128418,
      "y": -12481.984718322754,
      "width": 615.1596069335938,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ao",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1774522151,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1903316263,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781070968242,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "而是直接操作给定块的 `prev_free_block` 和 `next_free_block` 属性。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "而是直接操作给定块的 `prev_free_block` 和 `next_free_block` 属性。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Fjc4V8RLXIvdf2-0GdmpO",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 595.4632797241211,
      "y": -12411.984718322754,
      "width": 691.7391357421875,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ap",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1278483145,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1333902537,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781070968242,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The queue is ordered by block ID in the beginning. When a block is allocated",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The queue is ordered by block ID in the beginning. When a block is allocated",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "LKagIzLLzJtCrXdB6U5nZ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 653.0332260131836,
      "y": -12376.984718322754,
      "width": 576.5992431640625,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aq",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1422299719,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 807145543,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781070968242,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "and then freed, it will be appended back with the eviction order:",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "and then freed, it will be appended back with the eviction order:",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "DKqqslpzxAcFzVXVE-Vka",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 712.4231491088867,
      "y": -12341.984718322754,
      "width": 457.81939697265625,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ar",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 777509289,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 2074164137,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781070968242,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. The least recent used block is at the front (LRU).",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. The least recent used block is at the front (LRU).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "dl7S3f0PR00GssosqWQUB",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 641.0432968139648,
      "y": -12306.984718322754,
      "width": 600.5791015625,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "as",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1726656871,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1994420071,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781070968242,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. If two blocks have the same last accessed time (allocated by the",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. If two blocks have the same last accessed time (allocated by the",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "vMdkKAsMn3S4wvvt8lFKh",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 640.7832870483398,
      "y": -12271.984718322754,
      "width": 601.09912109375,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "at",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1465957513,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 959307401,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781070968242,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "same sequence), the one with more hash tokens (the tail of a block",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "same sequence), the one with more hash tokens (the tail of a block",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "nqPX2AXy_frw_rBh_beZJ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 848.6529769897461,
      "y": -12236.984718322754,
      "width": 185.3597412109375,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "au",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1501424775,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 537651847,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781070968242,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "chain) is at the front.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "chain) is at the front.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "I89dcBjUjjUbw6qNGlye0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 618.0732650756836,
      "y": -12201.984718322754,
      "width": 646.5191650390625,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "av",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1997161321,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 652420457,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781070968242,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Note that we maintain this order by reversing the block order when free",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Note that we maintain this order by reversing the block order when free",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "MYxuavGrwKhjmMbA880MN",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 682.1332321166992,
      "y": -12166.984718322754,
      "width": 518.3992309570312,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aw",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 138199975,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 140181927,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781070968242,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "blocks of a request. This operation is outside of this class.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "blocks of a request. This operation is outside of this class.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "1OINhqqgcTBESBSmiDNu-",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 546.0228805541992,
      "y": -12144.484718322754,
      "width": 790.6199340820312,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ax",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 966782537,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 823369,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781070968242,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "初始状态下，队列按块 ID 排序。当一个块被分配并随后释放时，它会根据以下淘汰顺序重\n新加入队列：",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "初始状态下，队列按块 ID 排序。当一个块被分配并随后释放时，它会根据以下淘汰顺序重新加入队列：",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Y1tGdV6flE0Iq0wDcS6ON",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 760.8728713989258,
      "y": -12071.984718322754,
      "width": 360.9199523925781,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ay",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 592688839,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1090139335,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781070968242,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. 最近最少使用（LRU）的块位于队首。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. 最近最少使用（LRU）的块位于队首。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "UHJgw_TZclgat_aZFJyCY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 563.7928695678711,
      "y": -12049.484718322754,
      "width": 755.0799560546875,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "az",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 905788713,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 176529193,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781070968242,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. 如果两个块的最后访问时间相同（即由同一序列分配），则包含更多哈希标记（hash\ntokens，即块链的末端）的块位于队首。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. 如果两个块的最后访问时间相同（即由同一序列分配），则包含更多哈希标记（hash tokens，即块链的末端）的块位于队首。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "A8I94hzXJ6FAxApU73oYt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 541.3328475952148,
      "y": -11989.484718322754,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b00",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 559891943,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 25560039,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781070968242,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "请注意，我们是通过在释放请求相关的空闲块时反转块的顺序来维护这一排序的；该操作在\n类外部进行。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "请注意，我们是通过在释放请求相关的空闲块时反转块的顺序来维护这一排序的；该操作在类外部进行。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "VX7ngR6tPYGpHJ5Ag89FT",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 917.3628768920898,
