      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781070968242,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "free_block_queue that could potentially be evicted.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "free_block_queue that could potentially be evicted.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "3zMOaatKDfEOZjr8kX_eh",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 671.3328475952148,
      "y": -11131.984718322754,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0J",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1012436457,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 271478761,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781070968242,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "被缓存的块是一个完整的块，拥有可用于前缀缓存的块哈希。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "被缓存的块是一个完整的块，拥有可用于前缀缓存的块哈希。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "-o5a_yBsY9ptU-R1sx-eC",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 551.9229354858398,
      "y": -11109.484718322754,
      "width": 778.81982421875,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0K",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1034838311,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 606052135,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781070968242,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "该缓存块可能正被正在运行的请求使用，也可能位于 `free_block_queue`（空闲块队列）\n中，",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "该缓存块可能正被正在运行的请求使用，也可能位于 `free_block_queue`（空闲块队列）中，",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "g7UrS3lu_fT0GaR1myPXD",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 861.3328475952148,
      "y": -11036.984718322754,
      "width": 160,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0L",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 62974153,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1720355529,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781070968242,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "随时可能被驱逐。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "随时可能被驱逐。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "53lUR67eVjyf2G_2jInnB",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 643.4331893920898,
      "y": -10966.984718322754,
      "width": 595.79931640625,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0M",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1135977543,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 89072199,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781070968242,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "NOTE #1: We currently don't de-duplicate the blocks in the cache,",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "NOTE #1: We currently don't de-duplicate the blocks in the cache,",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "IAzLbSGqTpT-imc_7uTMM",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 642.1232833862305,
      "y": -10931.984718322754,
      "width": 598.4191284179688,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0N",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 924510121,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 341854633,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781070968242,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "meaning that if a block becomes full and is cached, we don't check",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "meaning that if a block becomes full and is cached, we don't check",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "bY7hB9TYLQhzoMJUzLe5W",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 652.0132064819336,
      "y": -10896.984718322754,
      "width": 578.6392822265625,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0O",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 170361703,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 400638311,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781070968242,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "if there is already an identical block in the cache. This is because",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "if there is already an identical block in the cache. This is because",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "-WCnTbGu0FiErd3RPXQnL",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 638.2932357788086,
      "y": -10861.984718322754,
      "width": 606.0792236328125,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0P",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 814877321,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1121660041,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781070968242,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "we want to make sure the allocated block IDs won't change so that",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "we want to make sure the allocated block IDs won't change so that",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "kWULHN3bxk8-x5AR2-V8H",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 807.5429916381836,
      "y": -10826.984718322754,
      "width": 267.5797119140625,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0Q",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1632665223,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1294105735,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781070968242,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "block tables are append-only.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "block tables are append-only.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "SdCY_f4_vZMC9HDfsardS",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 642.2332382202148,
      "y": -10791.984718322754,
      "width": 598.19921875,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0R",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2028065129,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1773581161,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781070968242,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "NOTE #2: The union type is introduced in order to reduce GC costs",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "NOTE #2: The union type is introduced in order to reduce GC costs",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "WOgsce4ln9AQPKu6nhWBX",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 855.8329544067383,
      "y": -10756.984718322754,
      "width": 170.99978637695312,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0S",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1542264231,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 953111463,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781070968242,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "from the inner dict.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "from the inner dict.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "kPbVXEEhLob1Puz_9Vn9o",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 716.7228622436523,
      "y": -10721.984718322754,
      "width": 449.219970703125,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0T",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1968553033,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 2101239369,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781070968242,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "注意 #1：目前我们不对缓存中的块进行去重处理；",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "注意 #1：目前我们不对缓存中的块进行去重处理；",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Hycit2UHrVgFygepfzekP",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 591.3328475952148,
      "y": -10686.984718322754,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0U",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 19515591,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1125402311,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781070968242,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "这意味着当一个块填满并被缓存时，我们不会检查缓存中是否已存在相同的块。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "这意味着当一个块填满并被缓存时，我们不会检查缓存中是否已存在相同的块。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "asw5tUAKQIZzuciXibYHB",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 541.3429489135742,
      "y": -10664.484718322754,
      "width": 799.9797973632812,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0V",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1439255337,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1548594473,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781070968242,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "这样做的目的是确保已分配的块 ID 保持不变，从而保证块表（block tables）仅支持追加操\n作。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "这样做的目的是确保已分配的块 ID 保持不变，从而保证块表（block tables）仅支持追加操作。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "P5RAqYsz199EM5LVQc4-V",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 544.9829330444336,
      "y": -10591.984718322754,
      "width": 792.6998291015625,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0W",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1050875879,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 445502951,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781070968242,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "注意 #2：引入联合类型（union type）是为了降低内部字典带来的垃圾回收（GC）开销。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "注意 #2：引入联合类型（union type）是为了降低内部字典带来的垃圾回收（GC）开销。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "GtlfVLwkuEXNwIi-i9lCC",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 929.182861328125,
      "y": -10521.984718322754,
      "width": 24.299972534179688,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0X",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1118305801,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 2119180297,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781070968242,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\"\"\"",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\"\"\"",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
